{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "11abb3fc-6019-8fb5-97d1-a7dc8389b1cf",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T14:23:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jose Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. My name is Jose Castillo. Can you hear me okay? I'm in the car and the signal is bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, a little choppy. Go ahead, Jose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:18:29-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I have three things. First, I'm calling about plowing after the storm that came in Sunday and wrapped up today. Second, it's about a neighbor of mine. Third, I want you to log it, like put it on record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:18:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can do that. Where's the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:19:00-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 100 Broadway, in the North End. [line breaks up] ...the plow went through but it left a pile across the bottom of her walk and the end of her driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:19:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me there. 100 Broadway, and the plow left a pile at the end of whose driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:19:34-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My neighbor's. She's elderly. First, she lives alone. Second, she can't shovel. Third, she can't get out right now, the pile is too heavy and it's wet since it turned to rain. She needs a path."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:19:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is she okay otherwise? Does she need anything urgent, like medical help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:20:06-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, she's fine. She just can't get out. I'm not at home right now, I'm picking up a prescription refill on the way home, and then I'll look at it myself. But I want the city to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:20:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart. Let me get this down. Is her place the 100 Broadway address, or is that yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:20:42-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[crosstalk] ...mine is 100. Hers is next door, but the pile is basically at the line between us. So 100 Broadway is the spot to use."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:20:58-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the location is 100 Broadway, the windrow at the end of the driveway, and an elderly resident next door who can't get out. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:21:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. First, the windrow. Second, she's elderly. Third, it's heavy slush now, not light snow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:21:29-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Heavy slush, understood. I'll log it as a request to clear access. I'll flag that she can't get out so it's not treated like a regular driveway complaint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:21:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Will somebody come today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:21:52-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The crews are still working through the end of the storm, so I'd say sometime this afternoon into the evening, maybe later. I'll note it as a priority. Do you want a call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:22:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. First, call me if they're coming. Second, call if they can't. The number is 401-555-0156."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:22:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0156. And your name again, spelled for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:22:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Jose, J-O-S-E. Castillo, C-A-S-T-I-L-L-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:22:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Is there anyone else who can be at the house if the crew shows up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:22:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I should be there in about, um, forty minutes. [line breaks up] ...after the pharmacy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:22:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I heard forty minutes. I'll put that in the notes. Anything else, Jose?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:23:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Just those three. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:23:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Drive safe, the roads are slick. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:23:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, bye."
    }
  ],
